-- Migration 0105: Week 1 Campfire Phase 2 Data, Puzzles, Clicks, Nudges, Fenmark Quiet Opener, and Read-Backs (Piece E1)
-- 1. Load Week 1 campfire_days (series 'dark-moon', season 1, week 1, days 1..6) with approved Phase 2 data:
--    - Questions: Day 1 (Who wrote the list?), Day 2 (When was the child taken?), Day 3 (Who did the watcher work for?), Day 4 (Why Tamsin?), Day 5 (Same man or way of working?), Day 6 (Why our names on that list?).
--    - Clicks & Puzzles: Day 2 (Did Meira leave in a hurry? 1-2-2 + press), Day 3 (How long has this rock been watched? 1-3-1 + 1-3-2), Day 5 (Has someone tried her house? 1-5-2 + 1-5-3), Day 6 (Why cart one way? 1-6-2 + 1-6-3).
